# effect-coordinator-abandon-failed: r and its alias share the coordinator db.
# alias, the second enrolled Grant, leaves its file open and its abandonment
# fails: the would-be commit becomes a rollback, and only alias is disabled.
# In d2, r still begins and commits; in d3, alias is refused.

